== Inventory service ==
The '''inventory service''' keeps stock levels for every ''warehouse'' and answers reorder questions.

=== Endpoints ===
* <code>GET /orders</code> — the orders, newest first
* <code>POST /orders</code> — place an order
** returns <code>201 Created</code>
* <code>GET /healthz</code>

=== Configuration ===
{| class="wikitable"
! Key !! Default !! Notes
|-
| <code>REORDER_POINT</code> || 25 || per SKU
|-
| <code>LOG_LEVEL</code> || info || debug, info, warn
|}

See also [[Deployment guide]] and [https://example.com/docs the external docs].

<syntaxhighlight lang="bash">
curl -s https://api.example.com/orders | jq '.[0]'
</syntaxhighlight>

